<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1698] SqlFieldsQuery works incorrectly in case of topology changes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1698</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;SqlFieldsQuery&lt;/tt&gt; returns duplicate rows. Steps to reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start one node&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create cache nad populate data.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start second node&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Execute query&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Result: &lt;tt&gt;QueryCursor&lt;/tt&gt; retrieves duplicate rows.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See corresponding test in PR &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/162&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/162&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;testSqlFieldsQuery&lt;/tt&gt; passes, but &lt;tt&gt;testSqlFieldsQueryWithTopologyChanges&lt;/tt&gt; fails.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12905237">IGNITE-1698</key>
            <summary>SqlFieldsQuery works incorrectly in case of topology changes</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
